			"Message": "refactor(Output): Align build configuration imports with new directory structure\n\nCorrect relative import paths in `Apply/Pipeline.js` and `ESBuild/Exclude/Chromium/IPC.js` to accommodate the recent migration from flat CamelCase files to a nested, semantic PascalCase directory hierarchy. These changes fix broken module resolution caused by moving plugin artifacts and ESBuild configurations deeper into the file tree.\n\nKey modifications:\n• Update `Pipeline.js` imports to point from `Configuration/Apply/` to `../Plugin/` instead of the previous flat sibling path.\n• Adjust `Chromium/IPC.js` relative reference to the root `ESBuild.js` configuration file.\n• Update `README.md` documentation to reflect the moved `RestPlugin` file path.\n\nThese adjustments ensure the ESBuild pipeline resolves all dependencies correctly during the bundling process, maintaining the structural integrity of the `Output` element's build artifacts.",
